s count as static); Like get_symbol_info / get_document_outline / find_implementations staticFilter, this judges each returned symbol itself, unlike find_references / find_callers / get_diagnostics staticFilter, which judge the enclosing site symbol of each usage / call / diagnostic; combined with the other filters (all must match) and applied before maxResults; no match gives an empty result (empty Symbols, TotalCount = 0, Truncated = false); a value other than true/false (case-insensitive) is rejected with an error (the MCP tool reports INTERNAL_ERROR)");

